  faqs: { en: [
    { q: "Do I need to know how to code to build a Tradovate bot?", a: "To build directly on the API, yes, you'll be writing auth calls, a WebSocket handler, and order logic. If you'd rather not, a bridge like PickMyTrade turns TradingView alerts into Tradovate orders without any programming." },
    { q: "Why does my bot's order get rejected even though the code runs?", a: "The most common cause is a missing or false isAutomated flag on an automated order, which the exchange won't accept. After that, check for a wrong accountId/accountSpec, an expired token, or hitting the demo host with live credentials." },
